<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
    <comment location="PopErrorScopeCallbackInfoFFI">
        <summary>            
            Describes a callback to be called when an error scope is popped.
        </summary>
    </comment>
    <group prefix="PopErrorScopeCallbackInfoFFI.">
        <comment location="Mode">
            <summary>                
                The callback mode.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="Callback">
            <summary>                
                The callback to be called when an error scope is popped. Only one of Callback or OldCallback can be non-null.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="OldCallback">
            <summary>                
                The callback to be called when an error scope is popped. Only one of Callback or OldCallback can be non-null.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="Userdata1">
            <summary>                
                The first userdata to be passed to the callback.
            </summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="Userdata2">
            <summary>                
                The second userdata to be passed to the callback.
            </summary>
        </comment>
    </group>
</group>